            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A process for the hydrocyanation of an organic compound containing at least one olefinic group comprising reacting the organic compound with hydrogen cyanide in the presence of a catalyst complex comprising at least one transition metal and an organic ligand containing at least one P-N linkage, wherein the P and N atoms of the P-N linkage are each bonded to two other atoms.</p>
            </abstract>
